########################################
## INTRO POEM                         ##
##   Three lines chosen randomly...   ##
########################################
# Line 1
########################################
0x637ba759: Feeling the familiar grit to the surrounding sand,
0x76f44c73: With Yang's words echoing in my mind,
0x1d82bd9c: They've always told me that time was a closed circle,
0xaf6df946: After regathering my original colleagues,
0x73e69c18: Remembering how much I've accomplished up to this point,
0xcb62841c: Like meeting an old childhood friend,
0x6e5f187f: To the Moon and back,
0x22eedf5b: Reminiscing on my more youthful days,
0x0815ade4: To think I'd be here again,
########################################
# Line 2
########################################
0x5286275d: I gave my camel one more embrace,
0x987c752f: I did my morning stretch,
0xa7665cea: I let out a howl,
0x3c0b0bfb: I thought of my wife and daughter,
0x0128f1e2: I wiped my brow,
0xb06eb98b: I made my prayers,
0xadc47936: I shed a joyful tear,
0x44a9c4f1: I look back on the friends I've made,
0x27cf4476: I finished my canteen,
########################################
# Line 3
########################################
0x2b2819d4: And remembered why I've started this 17 years ago.
0xe39f18d0: And made way to finish what I started.
0x2302c927: And heard many intimate calls from below.
0x617daa8e: And I resubmit to the Ouroboros.
0x73bb309c: And made way to greet fate with a smile.
0xf8d73f7d: And discovered a new treasure worth more than anything.
0xcd0dd989: And ventured the depths with a skip in my step.
0x2d1dd80c: And made sure to not let hubris get the best of me.
0xd9cbcdbd: But wondered for how much longer i would last...
########################################
## JOURNAL - PEOPLE                   ##
########################################
0x4cffb84e: Ana Spelunky
0x501aba18: An energetic chip off the old block! She's currently on holiday, so no worrying about school, and more time exploring!
0x77e0c920: Margaret Tunnel
0x3e8419e1: Her ambitions to become a pirate are within sight! She's giving spelunking one more go before the sea becomes her new home.
0xe1043a58: Colin Northward
0xb524fd65: The eccentric explorer finalizing his research as he steps closer and closer to solving the mystery of the cursed caves.
0x1e3605c7: Roffy D. Sloth
0x63335ed2: He still keeps to himself, but through steady steps, Roffy has learned to open up more and share his surprisingly profound wisdom!
0x9aca0a10: Alto Singh
0x986a8602: Taking advantage of the treasure he would plunder, Alto started a fundraiser to help children in need of food and education!
0x14edb56e: Liz Mutton
0xee60d39d: After a particular conversation with Ana on the Moon, Liz ponders on the legacy she'd leave behind during her return back on Earth.
0xe917def2: Nekka The Eagle
0x99d74cda: After being refused by the gods to her questions, Nekka has then decided to continue on her quest to find her own solutions.
0x341d8303: LISE Project
0x60c85f81: It's still uncertain how many years left she has on her data collection. When asked, she simply smiled, and asked to not worry about it.
0x096d5635: Coco Von Diamonds
0xd27c281c: Now in retirement after lending her company to her daughter, Coco has all the time in the world to keep herself and Pearl entertained.
0xf9fb4ef8: Manfred Tunnel
0xb7bfb7dc: Tales are told of Manny's favorite unbreakable mattock that's been lost to time in these caves, still hoping to find it again.
0xb2ec4ddd: Little Jay
0x3bb483ca: Son of Big Jay, Now an admin at a spelunker dedicated forum to discuss his passionate advice to other aspiring spelunkers!
0xd0004144: Tina Flan
0x83fbe983: Eager to return after word got out about a certain tyrant in a particularly fiery locale reclaiming the throne!
0x695b0c1d: Valerie Crump
0x65c93186: Collaborating with Little Jay, the two are beginning their career path in game development by first making a mod for their favorite game!
0x201f7d9b: Au
0xa1307fed: Despite what it seems, this is actually a physical projection of Au, for the real Au has ascended and became one with the cosmos.
0x8a4ce3f3: Demi Von Diamonds
0xff4508db: Now wisened by her experience on the Moon, Demi regains the courage to return to the caves that once left her helpless.
0x2635de08: Pilot
0xc712ca50: Shortly after leaving the Moon, Pilot crash lands onto Earth after his ship collided with an asteroid. Poor guy!
0x6553b066: Princess Airyn
0x9f0228cb: Her culinary expertise gained worldwide praise, but her highness continues to seek more perspective as to not get too comfortable.
0x4e258ed5: Dirk Yamaoka
0xfe5e9c2e: Fufilling his duties on the Moon, Dirk returns to Earth to enact his final mission before becoming an elite master ninja!
0x995a90d8: Guy Spelunky
0x60f3346a: The spelunker veteran extraordinaire! Ready to give it another go after word of an old friend.
0x5da64272: Classic Guy
0x8d8715a7: The pixelated explorer seems more accustomed to this rasterized world, but is however disgruntled with the unfamiliarity of these caves.

0xc8946145: CRUSHED
0x45e8ca32: The no longer extinct mammoth used me as a welcome mat.